# Phase 2 baseline result artifacts are local-only by default. The Git repo
# keeps scripts, configs, docs, and memory summaries; regenerate Phase 2
# artifacts locally when needed.

# Phase 3 diagnostics keep scripts, reports, figures, metric summaries, and
# small audit tables versionable. Bulky row-level predictions stay local unless
# explicitly force-added after review.
analysis/phase3_diagnostics/**/*features*.csv
analysis/phase3_diagnostics/**/*predictions*.csv
analysis/phase3_diagnostics/**/personality_counterfactual_sensitivity.csv
analysis/phase3_diagnostics/**/phase3_fold_summaries.csv
analysis/phase3_diagnostics/**/subgroup_metrics_by_seed.csv
!analysis/phase3_diagnostics/**/*skipped_segments.csv

# Phase 5 minimal validation keeps summaries/reports versionable. Row-level
# predictions, learned representations, model weights, and caches remain local.
